      "id": "b-10-work-record-ford-explained-that-drop-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Ford explained that Dropbox was intended for automatic backup, but its permissions are troublesome, and a home NAS is planned. The working archive remains local. No automatic backup, NAS connection, cloud copy of the new archive, restore test, or retirement of Wispr has occurred."
